cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EML-GA²M / Canonical Pools: complete function-space enumeration for EML symbolic regression"
abstract: >-
  Canonical function-pool enumeration for symbolic regression over the
  single binary operator eml(x, y) = exp(x) - log(y): the reachable
  function space collapses by five orders of magnitude relative to its
  syntax, enabling complete enumeration to depth 4, analytic root
  inversion for depth-5 exact recovery, minimal-depth certificates, a
  mechanistic theory of the depth wall, and SafePoolGAM — an additive
  model with certified safe extrapolation on tabular data.
